&lt;p&gt;This&amp;nbsp;mini-symposium&amp;nbsp;will bring together investigators and clinicians from across Columbia to introduce the initiative, share highlights of ongoing research in hematologic malignancies, and outline opportunities for collaboration, education, and future programming.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The event will feature an overview of the initiative&amp;rsquo;s goals and structure, research presentations spanning discovery through clinical application, and time for discussion and connection across disciplines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All faculty, trainees, and staff with an interest in hematologic malignancies are encouraged to attend.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
