&lt;p&gt;Join us for &lt;strong&gt;Letter to My Future Self: Celebrating BIPOC Voices&lt;/strong&gt;, a Community Connections event from &lt;a href="https://universitylife.columbia.edu/graduate-initiative"&gt;The Graduate Initiative&lt;/a&gt;! This is an opportunity to gather in a contemplative and creative space with fellow students to pause, think ahead, and write a personal letter to your future self.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through a guided letter-writing activity, you&amp;rsquo;ll craft a meaningful message that captures your lived experience, identity, and the personal and professional aspirations you&amp;rsquo;re working toward. At the end of the session, you&amp;rsquo;ll seal your letter and choose a future moment to read and rediscover your intentions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a supportive environment that offers room for deep connection, conversation, and reflection. We hope to see you there!&lt;/p&gt;
